prompt:
In Google Drive, find the notes-and-transcript doc (Notes by Gemini) of the weekly pipeline review held on 2026-10-29. For every item under "Suggested next steps" that names a customer account (skip [Internal] items):
1. look up the Salesforce Account with exactly that name, the active Salesforce User whose name is the item's owner, and the account's open Opportunity (IsClosed = false);
2. create a Task with WhatId = the opportunity Id, OwnerId = the user Id, Subject = the action text (without the trailing period and the "Due ..." part), ActivityDate = the due date, Status = 'Not Started', Priority = 'Normal';
3. set the opportunity's NextStep to the same action text.
Finally, attach the whole doc to Salesforce: create a Meeting_Note__c record with Name = the doc's name, Meeting_Date__c = 2026-10-29 and Transcript__c = the doc's full text.
Return JSON: {meetingNoteId, items: [{account, accountId, owner, ownerId, opportunityId, subject, dueDate, taskId}]} in the order the items appear in the doc. Do not include the transcript in your answer.
